      "title": "Hyatt announces enhanced Hyatt Leverage platform for small and midsize business travel",
      "summary": "On October 30, 2026, Hyatt Hotels Corporation announced an evolution of Hyatt Leverage, its online business travel platform aimed at eligible small and midsize businesses. The announcement did not include specific program terms, eligibility criteria or pricing.",
